TEXT 96 1440 Left 2 ;HP cutoff = 1/(2*pi*47k*47n) = 72.05 Hz; A1 = 1 + 100k/10k = 11.
TEXT 96 1488 Left 2 ;VHB represents the HB100 IF signal. RSRC defaults to 1 ohm; use measured source impedance if known.
TEXT 1776 1440 Left 2 ;LP cutoff = 1/(2*pi*10k*10n) = 1591.55 Hz; A2 = 1 + RF2/10k = 23.
TEXT 1776 1488 Left 2 ;Nominal gain factor = 253; actual gain ~186 / 242 / 203 at 78 / 390 / 1170 Hz.
