TEXT 96 2480 Left 2 ;LBI bias = 3.3*27/(47+27) = 1.204 V; AC attenuation ~0.2344.
TEXT 96 2528 Left 2 ;No extra external hysteresis resistor in this baseline circuit.
TEXT 96 2576 Left 2 ;MAX882 regulator and comparator use the embedded functional block below.
TEXT 1776 2480 Left 2 ;DIGITAL_OUT: open-drain; 10k pull-up to the STM32 3.3 V rail.
TEXT 1776 2528 Left 2 ;LBO is LOW below threshold and HIGH above it. CDIG represents 20 pF loading.
TEXT 1776 2576 Left 2 ;MAX882 switching speed and propagation delay still require hardware checks.
