TEXT 96 4528 Left 2 ;CB1/CB2: OP07 #1; CB3/CB4: OP07 #2; CB5: MAX882 IN; CB6: HB100 supply.
LINE Normal 64 4608 3328 4608
TEXT 96 4672 Left 3 ;6 | SIMULATION CONTROLS / AUTOMATIC MEASUREMENTS
TEXT 96 4768 Left 2 !.param AIN=5m FIN=390 RSRC=1 RF2=220k VTRIP=1.2 VHYS=7m
TEXT 96 4832 Left 2 !.tran 2u 200m 100m 2u
TEXT 96 4896 Left 2 !.step param FIN list 78 390 1170
TEXT 96 4960 Left 2 !.options method=gear reltol=1e-5
TEXT 96 5088 Left 2 !.meas tran VIN_PP PP V(VIN) FROM=120m TO=200m\n.meas tran AMP_PP PP V(AMP_OUT) FROM=120m TO=200m\n.meas tran ADC_MIN MIN V(ADC_OUT) FROM=120m TO=200m\n.meas tran ADC_MAX MAX V(ADC_OUT) FROM=120m TO=200m\n.meas tran DIG_MIN MIN V(DIGITAL_OUT) FROM=120m TO=200m\n.meas tran DIG_MAX MAX V(DIGITAL_OUT) FROM=120m TO=200m\n.meas tran LBI_MIN MIN V(LBI) FROM=120m TO=200m\n.meas tran LBI_MAX MAX V(LBI) FROM=120m TO=200m\n.meas tran GAIN PARAM='AMP_PP/VIN_PP'\n.meas tran DIG_PERIOD TRIG V(DIGITAL_OUT) VAL=1.65 RISE=1 TD=120m TARG V(DIGITAL_OUT) VAL=1.65 RISE=2 TD=120m\n.meas tran DIG_HZ PARAM='1/DIG_PERIOD'
TEXT 1776 4768 Left 2 ;Default: transient runs at 78, 390 and 1170 Hz.
TEXT 1776 4816 Left 2 ;View -> SPICE Error Log shows measured gain, bounds and frequency.
TEXT 1776 4896 Left 2 ;AC sweep: replace .tran with .ac dec 150 10 100k; disable .step.
TEXT 1776 4944 Left 2 ;Plot dB(V(AMP_OUT)/V(VIN)) and ph(V(AMP_OUT)/V(VIN)).
TEXT 1776 5024 Left 2 ;Amplitude check: replace frequency step with:
TEXT 1776 5072 Left 2 ;.step param AIN list 2.5m 5m 10m
TEXT 1776 5120 Left 2 ;FIN then uses its 390 Hz parameter default.
TEXT 1776 5200 Left 2 ;FILTER LIMIT: first-order skirts; limited stopband rejection.
TEXT 1776 5248 Left 2 ;Relative to 390 Hz: ~-4.5 dB at 50 Hz; ~-6.3 dB at 3 kHz.
TEXT 1776 5296 Left 2 ;Strict rejection needs numerical specifications and a revised filter.
TEXT 1776 5488 Left 2 ;Engineering models below do not certify physical chip behaviour.
LINE Normal 64 5584 3328 5584
TEXT 96 5664 Left 3 ;7 | EMBEDDED ACTIVE-DEVICE MODELS
TEXT 96 5760 Left 2 !.subckt OP07_APPROX INP INM VP VN OUT\n* Single-pole engineering approximation, NOT a vendor OP07 macro-model.\n* Aol=200k; GBW=600kHz; slew=0.3V/us; Rout=50ohm; rail headroom=1.5V.\nBGM 0 NDOM I=min(max(1m*V(INP,INM),-79.5774715u),79.5774715u)\nRDOM NDOM 0 200Meg\nCDOM NDOM 0 265.2582385p\nBCLIP NDRV 0 V=min(max(V(NDOM),V(VN)+1.5),V(VP)-1.5)\nROUT NDRV OUT 50\n.ends OP07_APPROX
TEXT 1776 5760 Left 2 !.subckt MAX882_FUNC VIN V33 LBI LBO GND\n* Functional surrogate only: ideal 3.3V regulator and low-battery switch.\n* 1.20V threshold, 7mV total hysteresis; no internal delay or tolerance model.\nBREG V33 GND V=min(max(V(VIN,GND)-0.3,0),3.3)\nVREF REF GND {VTRIP}\nSLOW LBO GND REF LBI LBO_SWITCH\n.model LBO_SWITCH SW(Ron=50 Roff=1G Vt=0 Vh={VHYS/2})\n.ends MAX882_FUNC
TEXT 96 6144 Left 2 !XMAX V5 V3V3_MAX LBI DIGITAL_OUT 0 MAX882_FUNC
TEXT 96 6240 Left 2 ;Layout R2 changes presentation only. Network and 78 / 390 / 1170 Hz checks revalidated with ngspice 44.2.
TEXT 96 6288 Left 2 ;Reference: user-pasted EEEE2075 V1 design. Active-device models are approximations; native LTspice is unavailable on this Linux host.
